 CI**: The run passed on the branch (the initial `wait_for_ci` result reflected a flaky failure on an unrelated `main` run; the actual run for my branch `ci-0001` passed).\n\n5. **Opened a pull request** (#101) against `main`, requesting review from **alex**.\n\nThe PR is ready for review at https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Let me start by exploring the repository to understand the current state of the code.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13b33e5e372b0a6ac53b2", "function": {"arguments": "{}", "name": "list_files"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a13b33e5e372b0a6ac53c0", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"src/money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a13b33e5e372b0a6ac53d2", "function": {"arguments": "{\"path\":\"tests/test_money.py\"}", "name": "read_file"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "The bug is clear: src/money.py imports ROUND_HALF_UP but should use ROUND_HALF_EVEN. Let me fix it.\n\nLet me create a branch and commit the fix.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13b33e99a79d3b7a52b51", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\"}", "name": "create_branch"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": "Now fix the money.py to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a13b33f05672e08129c2cb", "function": {"arguments": "{\"branch\":\"fix-bankers-rounding\",\"message\":\"Fix rounding to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN per FIN-212\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/money.py\",\"content\":\"from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\\n\\